n>太古城海景花園海棠閣一單位疑冷氣機起火，消防趕抵灌救。（Sze Chung / 筲箕灣西灣河關注組）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T12:16:53.901432+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":848,"images":14,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}